sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Reviewer
  participant CI as GitLab Pipeline
  participant Worker as Protected Worker
  participant BR as Authorized lab target
  participant Core as Test Peer/Core
  participant Evidence
  CI->>Worker: Start approved pre-check job
  Worker->>BR: Verify identity and collect configuration
  Worker->>BR: Collect interfaces, CPU, memory, and OSPF state
  Worker->>Core: Collect route and reachability baseline
  Worker->>Evidence: Store baseline, backup, and proposed diff
  CI-->>Reviewer: Present scope, diff, and pre-check evidence
  Reviewer->>CI: Approve lab deployment
  CI->>Worker: Deploy bound commit, image, target, and diff
  Worker->>BR: Apply approved scenario intent
  BR-->>Worker: Configuration response
  Worker->>BR: Read configuration and operational state
  Worker->>Core: Verify route and reachability
  Worker->>Evidence: Store post-check and change transcript
  alt All required outcomes pass
    CI-->>Reviewer: Permit promotion
  else Configuration or operation fails
    CI->>Worker: Stop promotion and run approved recovery
    Worker->>BR: Roll back or remediate
    Worker->>Core: Validate restored service
    Worker->>Evidence: Store recovery evidence
  end
